 <h3 class="ptype-title">Via Quest</h3>
 <p class="ptype-desc">Your protocol gets a dedicated quest on the ONBOARD3 platform. Users learn about your product step by step — follow, interact, explore — and earn XP for every completed task. You get genuinely onboarded users, not just clicks.</p>
 <div class="ptype-benefits">
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Verified user actions — no bots, no fakes</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Structured educational onboarding tasks</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Custom quest design with your branding</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Real-time completion analytics & reports</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>XP-incentivized — sky-high completion rates</span></div>
 </div>
 <a href="#partner-form" class="ptype-cta">Design a Quest <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
 </div>

 <!-- ── EVENTS ── -->
 <div class="ptype-card reveal-up" style="--d:80ms">
 <div class="ptype-glow"></div>
 <div class="ptype-top">
 <div class="ptype-icon-wrap">
 <div class="ptype-icon-ring"></div>
 <div class="ptype-icon"><i class="fas fa-map-pin"></i></div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <h3 class="ptype-title">Via Events</h3>
 <p class="ptype-desc">Co-host IRL campus meetups or city-wide virtual events with ONBOARD3. We bring the audience, curriculum, and energy. You bring your brand and vision. Together we create unforgettable Web3 experiences students actually remember.</p>
 <div class="ptype-benefits">
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Direct IRL access to Web3-curious students</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Live brand presence — booths, banners, talks</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Event logistics handled by our team</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Social amplification before, during & after</span></div>
 <div class="ptype-benefit"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Post-event report: reach, photos, metrics</span></div>
 </div>
 <a href="#partner-form" class="ptype-cta">Host an Event <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
 </div>

